us and his mother  takes him to be to the doctor to have  him surgically transitioned and gets him  walrus hormone pills and then eventually  tries to drop him off at a zoo to live  with other walruses this amazon has  decided is an lgbt story  there would seem to be a certain  admission being made here i don't know  and you might even say that by writing a  trans-walrus kids book and not only  topping the amazon charts but getting  the book classified as lgbt our plan has  worked perfectly you might say that this  whole thing is our trolling masterpiece  our sistine chapel of trolling that's  one interpretation  but it's not the conclusion that i  choose to draw from this situation if  you want to impress your family heading  into the holidays and maybe finally earn  the respect you deserve uh then this is  the way to do it establish titles is  your opportunity to earn the title of  lord or lady and gain the respect you  deserve  i still have not gained a lot of respect  because i i had a frame for my  established titles document and it was  taken from me so now i guess i'll just  tack it up on the wall like so but all  you need is a one square foot plot of  land in scotland and then you are a lord  or lady established titles is a project  based on historic scottish custom where  landowners are referred to as lairds or  lords and ladies in english in your  title pack you'll receive at least one  square foot of dedicated land on a  private estate and an official  certificate with a crest your  certificate will include a unique plot  number with which you can see the exact  location of your land um establish  titles is having a great limited time  sale so go to establishtitles.com matt  walsh to save 10 off today remember to  use the discount code matt walsh or just  click the link below that's established  titles.com matt walsh or just click the  link below personally i take quite  seriously my new status as the leading  lgbt voice in the nation  i never expected to